    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the ruins of the Astral Sanctuary, a mystical realm where the boundaries of magic and logic intertwine. The air is thick with ancient arcane energy, and before you lies the Grand Gate, the only way back to the mortal world. For centuries, archmages sought to seal a dark entity here, leaving behind complex mystical artifacts to ensure only the worthy could operate the sanctuary's mechanisms.\n\nTo open the gate, you must navigate a web of enchanted objects—from whispering stones and sealed grimoires to burning crucibles. Each relic holds a piece of the grand puzzle, waiting for the right magical spark to awaken. However, the path is not linear. You must carefully explore the chambers, uncover dormant tools, and channel the energies between them. The stars align above, casting a celestial glow upon the mysterious pedestals and altars scattered around you. Can you decipher the flow of magic, connect the ancient relics, and unlock the final barrier before the sanctuary collapses into the void? Your journey into the arcane begins now.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
